  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Soursop Competitive Project - Enhancing Sanitary  Phytosanitary Capacity, food safety  market access</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">To implement the proper SPS measures and interventions along the supply chain to safeguard this USD 2.6 million industry.
take advantage of current favourable access 
To expand and strengthen the soursop industry and ensure the sustainability of the approximately 2,600 farmer livelihoods (70% of whom are small holders).
To safeguard and increase the livelihoods of all actors in the Grenadian Soursop Value Chain through pairing SPS interventions with production and value chain interventions that will allow for increased exports and possible diversification into new products and markets.</narrative>
  </description>
